{"about_the_game":"Have you ever dreamed of having your own museum where you can collect monsters?<br />\r\nDream no further, because now you can do it in Monster Museum!<br />\r\nIn this world, you can summon and collect monsters inspired by mythologies around the world and display them at your very own museum.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n- Manage your own museum<br />\r\n- More than 50 monsters to collect and discover<br />\r\n- Buy decorations and make your museum the best to fit your style<br />\r\n- Tons of minigames! Such as fishing, planting, treasure hunting and many more<br />\r\n- Combine monsters to increase its tier and power<br />\r\n- Explore the city and find all the secrets!<br />\r\n- Follow the exciting story about the city<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnd most importantly, make your monster museum the best in the world!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2358440?t=1729504134","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2358440?t=1729504134","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358440/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1729504134","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358440/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1729504134","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Have you ever dreamed of having your own museum where you can collect monsters?<br />\r\nDream no further, because now you can do it in Monster Museum!<br />\r\nIn this world, you can summon and collect monsters inspired by mythologies around the world and display them at your very own museum.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n- Manage your own museum<br />\r\n- More than 50 monsters to collect and discover<br />\r\n- Buy decorations and make your museum the best to fit your style<br />\r\n- Tons of minigames! Such as fishing, planting, treasure hunt